{"name": "Spire of Chaos : Arcana Unleashed", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras_big/256c90ecb0fd50bf825b26364724e4b6.webp?t=1778589820\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/256c90ecb0fd50bf825b26364724e4b6.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a magical girl empowered by the Tower tarot card, wielding chaos-driven abilities that turn collapse into opportunities to escape her own domain.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/1e165b75ee29a10b5d117f42528db8de.poster.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/1e165b75ee29a10b5d117f42528db8de.webm?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/1e165b75ee29a10b5d117f42528db8de.mp4?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras_big/e9b47ba5bef02dd007da1d4600148e10.webp?t=1778589820\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/e9b47ba5bef02dd007da1d4600148e10.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse an Art Nouveau inspired tower shaped by the Arcana of the Tower itself, chaotic and celestial, but slowly overtaken by the Lovers, an opposing force that twists the domain as your escape draws closer. It is too dangerous to go alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/b6b500d5f5629cb0aefe36ec11a3b2ea.poster.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/b6b500d5f5629cb0aefe36ec11a3b2ea.webm?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/b6b500d5f5629cb0aefe36ec11a3b2ea.mp4?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras_big/70662d0621108059c212f56cf33bd680.webp?t=1778589820\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/70662d0621108059c212f56cf33bd680.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A loyal companion who guides you through every fight, happily helping you light the Tower up as you wreck your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/170ee5b6a977bf56b37562e7fdefa558.poster.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/170ee5b6a977bf56b37562e7fdefa558.webm?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/170ee5b6a977bf56b37562e7fdefa558.mp4?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras_big/ab22f8299180a22c98136e8f6ff878e4.webp?t=1778589820\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/ab22f8299180a22c98136e8f6ff878e4.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Smash enemies up close with an arcana-forged mace, channeling raw lightning into every brutal strike,\u00a0until it erupts into a devastating ultimate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"562\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/91e7f1c10da96d46c9ec3446d47c45d1.poster.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/91e7f1c10da96d46c9ec3446d47c45d1.webm?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/91e7f1c10da96d46c9ec3446d47c45d1.mp4?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras_big/8339efc8fbb654799cb539fc1af85efe.webp?t=1778589820\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/8339efc8fbb654799cb539fc1af85efe.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront a boss, the Lovers arcana in Tarot, split in two and evolving across three phases: unity, division, and devastating solitude. Your fate is decided here: freedom or eternal imprisonment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/ef8881bed49a4c43c4dc01c169def501.poster.avif?t=1778589820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/ef8881bed49a4c43c4dc01c169def501.webm?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/extras/ef8881bed49a4c43c4dc01c169def501.mp4?t=1778589820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Spire of Chaos: Arcana Unleashed is a 3D souls-lite action game where you play as Arxis, a magical girl linked to the Tower, a source of chaotic power and one of the most feared arcana of the Tarot.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140180/2ddcec6f06fc521f70c0ce421af9cab72f72866d/header.jpg?t=1778589820", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "Action-Adventure", "Souls-like", "3D", "Third Person"], "developers": "Hidden Gems", "publishers": "Hidden Gems", "release_date": "Apr 10, 2026", "price": "Free", "appid": "4140180", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "10 April 2026 - Free", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/nWwlzn6Yt7o", "first_seen": 1775772000.0, "review_rank": 857}